OL,3,GNEWSADistinctive outfit could be key to
OL,4,Ashooting, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating a shooting in
OL,7,FLiverpool have released images of a
OL,8,Fperson whose distinctive
OL,9,Fhigh-visibility clothing and bag might
OL,10,Fhelp to identify them.
OL,12,FThe appeal comes after reports a gun
OL,13,Fwas fired on Trefoil Close, Toxteth at
OL,14,Fabout 13:20 BST on 23 September. No
OL,15,Finjuries or damage were reported,
OL,16,FMerseyside Police said.
OL,18,FDetectives have released images of the
OL,19,Fperson wearing a bright orange
OL,20,Fhigh-visibility jacket and trousers, a
OL,21,Fblack balaclava, black gloves and black
OL,22,Fbag.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
