OL,5,
OL,6,F"Although the image does not show the
OL,7,Fperson's face, we think the distinctive
OL,8,Fclothing and bag may jog someone's
OL,9,Fmemory," Det Insp Chris Clark from the
OL,10,FFirearms Investigation Team said.
